<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Skoda Auto agrees union wage deal.</title>
<headline>Czech Skoda Auto agrees union wage deal.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Volkswagen AG's Czech unit, Skoda Automobilova a.s., said on Tuesday it had agreed with its unions to raise wages an average of 10.1 percent this year, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;In the framework of negotiations of a collective agreement the management of (Skoda) settled with the leadership of the trade union Kovo,&quot; it said.</p>
</text>
